% Scenario: a form paints where its matrix puts it. Under a CTM scaled
% by two, a form with Matrix [1 0 0 1 100 100] is placed by the matrix
% [2 0 0 2 200 200]; its body is captured once, in form space, clipped
% to the box.
/F << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 100 100]
  /PaintProc { pop 0 0 1 1 rectfill } >> def
2 2 scale
F execform
showpage
